{"1372990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PBA Basketball Slam: Arcade Edition", "steam_appid": 1372990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PBA Basketball Slam: Arcade Edition! This zany and quirky 2v2 arcade-style basketball game features epic moves, high-flying dunks, and witty commentary that will keep you at the end of your seats. Its basketball stripped down to its most fun and basic components which makes it easy to pick-up and enjoy..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 vs 2 full court basketball game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 2v2 local multiplayer or 2v2 coop vs AI players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny game commentator in different languages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action packed matches and EXAGGERATED gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ELECTRIFIED and do high flying dunks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your ELECTRIFIED METER!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO Fouls and pure on court basketball FUN.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE YOUR ELECTRIFIED METER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372990/extras/b7b53f2a600eaa6298407583e33833b4.poster.avif?t=1788118081\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372990/extras/b7b53f2a600eaa6298407583e33833b4.webm?t=1788118081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372990/extras/b7b53f2a600eaa6298407583e33833b4.mp4?t=1788118081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each successful 